      "writtenOn": "2019-04-29T22:54:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it protects flash contents from concurrent modifications by functions/threads changing of TPM and (key,value) objects.\n\ngetvar() returns a buffer with a copy of the tuple, so flash modifications after getvar() exits will not affect the returned value.",
      "parentUuid": "cbddc5d8_c3d97bd7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 320,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 320,
